<div class="page-header"><h1 class="page-header__title">Pilot and Pricing</h1><p class="page-header__subtitle">What to expect from this HelloDeploy instance.</p></div>
<div class="card prose"><div class="card__body"><h2>Free active pilot</h2><p>Accounts are currently open after email verification and use is free within the published limits. No future price or continued free availability is promised.</p><h2>Availability and recovery</h2><p>This is shared pilot infrastructure without a service-level agreement. The operator maintains platform recovery procedures, but HelloDeploy does not back up or administer databases used by deployed applications.</p><h2>Support</h2><p>Support is best-effort through the operator contact published in the legal and service-limit pages. Features, limits, and availability may change during the pilot.</p><p><a href="/service-limits">Review service limits</a> · <a href="/status">Current service status</a> · <a href="/terms">Terms</a></p></div></div>
